        {
          "text": "Basi, Ahabu akamwambia Yezebeli habari ya mambo yote aliyoyafanya Eliya, na jinsi alivyowaua manabii wote kwa upanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.1",
