        },
        {
          "text": "Akainuka, akala, akanywa, akaenda katika nguvu za chakula hicho siku arobaini mchana na usiku hata akafika Horebu, mlima wa Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.8",
