        },
        {
          "text": "Naye akawaacha ng’ombe, akamfuata Eliya mbio, akasema, Nipe ruhusa, nakuomba, nimbusu baba yangu na mama yangu, kisha mimi nitakufuata. Akamwambia, Enenda, urudi; ni nini niliyokutendea? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
